        "type": "data",
        "title": "OneAgent configuration by host",
        "query": "fetch dt.entity.host\n| fieldsAdd osType, monitoringMode, installerVersion, hostGroupName, cpuCores, physicalMemory, state\n| fields Host = entity.name, OS = osType, `Monitoring mode` = monitoringMode, `OneAgent version` = installerVersion,\n    `Host group` = hostGroupName, `CPU cores` = cpuCores, `Memory (GiB)` = round(physicalMemory / 1073741824.0, decimals: 1), State = state\n| sort Host asc",
