        "content": "### 🎯 Thresholds used\n| Metric | Healthy (blue) | Alert |\n|---|---|---|\n| Avg response time | < 500 ms | ≥ 500 ms 🔴 |\n| P90 response time | < 1000 ms | ≥ 1000 ms 🔴 |\n| Failure rate | < 1 % | ≥ 1 % 🔴 |\n| Avg CPU | < 80 % | ≥ 80 % 🔴 |\n| Avg memory | < 85 % | ≥ 85 % 🔴 |\n| Fullest disk | < 90 % | ≥ 90 % 🟠 |\n| Open problems | 0 | ≥ 1 🔴 |\n\nChange thresholds in the tile colour rules (and update this table)."
      }
